Title: Stochastic low-frequency variability of 50 massive stars in the Cygnus OB
associations and the Small Magellanic Cloud
Authors: M. G. Pedersen and L. Bildsten
Table: Table A1: Cygnus OB sample overview
================================================================================
Byte-by-byte Description of file: table_A1.mrt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Bytes Format Units  Label     Explanations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1- 19   A19    ---    Gaia EDR3      Gaia EDR3 ID
 21- 29   I9     ---    TIC            TESS Input Catalog ID
 31- 31   A1     ---    Group          Cygnus OB group ID
 33- 37   F5.2   mag    T             [6.67/15.96] TESS magnitude
 39- 43   F5.2   mag    G             [6.73/17.15] Gaia G magnitude
 45- 48   F4.2   K      log_Teff      [4.03/4.66] log10 effective temperature
 50- 53   F4.2   K      e_log_Teff    [0.02/0.57] Lower uncertainty on log10
                                    effective temperature
 55- 58   F4.2   K      E_log_Teff    [0.01/0.15] Upper uncertainty on log10
                                    effective temperature
 60- 63   F4.2   solLum log_L         [1.71/5.78] log10 luminosity
 65- 68   F4.2   solLum e_log_L       [0.03/0.96] Lower uncertainty on log10
                                    luminosity
 70- 73   F4.2   solLum E_log_L       [0.04/0.5] Upper uncertainty on log10
                                    luminosity
 75- 79   F5.2   solMass M             [2.47/52.72] Mass
 81- 85   F5.2   solMass e_M           [0.24/32.35] Lower uncertainty mass
 87- 91   F5.2   solMass E_M           [0.27/37.94] Upper uncertainty on mass
 93-118   A26    ---    FFI sectors    TESS sectors with FFI data
120-142   A23    ---    2-min sectors  TESS sectors with 2-min cadence data

